     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §11-0914, En Con L",
    "lawSection": "Environmental Conservation Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S5694\n\nSPONSOR: MARTUCCI\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to\nadding certain wildlife management units to the yearling buck protection\nprogram\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nAdd WMUs 3H & 3K to the yearling buck program\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends the Environmental Conservation Law to add WMUs 3H & 3K\nto the yearling buck program\n\nSection 2 is the effective date JUSTIFICATION:  The Sullivan County\nFederation of Sportsmen has requested this bill.  Yearling buck\nprotection already exists in WMU 3A and this bill would expand the\nprogram to the other WMUs roughly corresponding to the borders of Sulli-\nvan County.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
